<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>when you use the fortnite hammer it gives you a delay with this macro you can throw the hammer so that the delay will restart and have broken the structures in front very valuable in arena to repace the walls of the enemies or go inside his boxes enjoy it :)</Description>
